    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harry Brann Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this 2 bedroomed first-floor apartment overlooking Harbour Village Marina in the popular lakeside town of Killaloe - Presented to the market in excellent condition, the property comes with the added bonus of a private berth with direct access to magical Lough Derg - The property represents an ideal starter, downsizer or holiday opportunity for the would-be purchaser - Viewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "To Include - Entrance Hall, Open-Plan Kitchen/Dining/Lounge Area, 2 Bedrooms - 1 Ensuite, Bathroom, Storage Closet & Hot Press."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.39m x 1.12m \r\nCarpeted. Coat/storage closet.\r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Lounge/Dining/Kitchen Area - \r\n\r\n\r\nLounge/Dining Area - 5.61m x 4.28m \r\nCombined carpet & laminated oak timber floor covering. Electric fire insert in pine surround fireplace with granite hearth & insert. TV  telephone points. Double French doors to west-facing balcony area overlooking Harbour Village Marina.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 5.83m x 3.49m \r\nFully fitted cherrywood units to include integrated electric oven, hob & extractor. Plumbed for washing machine & dishwasher. Over-counter tiling. Spot lighting.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 1 - 4.95m x 3.07m \r\nCarpeted. 3-door built-in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nEn-suite - \r\nIncluded Above. Half wall & floor tiled & fully tiled around shower area. Electric shower off mains, WC & WHB. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.07m x 2.02m \r\nHalf wall & floor tiled & fully tiled around bath area. Shower-head unit over bath, WC & WHB. Recessed lighting. Extractor fan. Hot-press located here also.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.23m x 2.64m \r\nCarpeted.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Mains gas central heating. Mains water & sewerage. \r\nPVC double glazed windows & private balcony doors. Hardwood front entrance door.\r\nPrivate entrance door. Lift service from ground floor.\r\nBuilt in 2007. Private Berth No 4 with access to Lough Derg. \r\nCommunal parking to rear.\r\nActive Management Company."
      },
